# A password being set takes every character typed, so that its check
# sees a space or a seventeenth character: NEWBIE's forced change refuses
# a new password of 17 characters and one with a space, then takes one
# of 16 (LINK_PWMAX), with which NEWBIE logs in again.  In ADMIN's user
# form the server refuses a password with a space for NEWBIE.
T NEWBIE
K ENTER
T newbie86
K ENTER
T newbie86
K TAB
T ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQ
K TAB
T ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQ
K CTRL-S
S LONG
K STAB CTRL-Y
T my pass1
K TAB CTRL-Y
T my pass1
K CTRL-S
S SPACE
K STAB CTRL-Y
T Newbie1986abcdef
K TAB CTRL-Y
T Newbie1986abcdef
K CTRL-S
S CHANGED
K ENTER ALT-O
T L
S LOGIN
T NEWBIE
K ENTER
T Newbie1986abcdef
K ENTER
S RELOGIN
K ALT-O
T L
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-A
T U
K DOWN DOWN ENTER CTRL-E PGDN UP
T my pass1
K TAB
T my pass1
K CTRL-S
S ADMSPACE
K ESC
T Y
K ESC F3
T Y
